.ogg"},{"description":"Serina_Growup_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"もっと健康になった感じです！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/ri4BNzdPcAjRgDewMwNSCUk4yPsDFJnL.ogg"},{"description":"Serina_Growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"この力は……体調が悪い人たちに分けてあげられたら良いのに。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/ZhJvPzahiA8KgLPjoKFatyBAPt8HrEli.ogg"},{"description":"Serina_Growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"体調が悪い人たちのために、もっと努力します！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/J5z9A4n4JQZ5flhR9Hn43VynYlLH3C7R.ogg"},{"description":"Serina_Growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"私も少しは成長したんでしょうか。えへへへ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/rJKEmRtFWw4HcXMUzLT0mq1jIfBvzMjV.ogg"},{"description":"Serina_Lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"あっ、新たな患者さんですか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/epPojPzhSJsc3J0lnXFpkzVkcSrSvyW2.ogg"},{"description":"Serina_Lobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"お疲れのようですね…肩でも揉んでさしあげましょうか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/igLiea4mHmO64cW4H5hJlusazTPV2E0x.ogg"},{"description":"Serina_Lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"疲れは万病の元！あまり無理しないでくださいね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/YfKpJfY28TfWCKSURDi82CGE9c4UCeiW.ogg"},{"description":"Serina_Lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"患者さんたちのことを思うと、いつも胸が痛みます。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/r66oXF39JXvAHohvCzfUidciQSUyctvs.ogg"},{"description":"Serina_Lobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"平和を乱す悪党は許せません！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E