みません、ちょっと混乱してしまったのですが……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/tKCVxrKohqhee5oPIf1ztNRVO4hBbQz0.ogg"},{"description":"Serina_MemorialLobby_4_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ありがとうございます、とっても嬉しいです……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/w10PuLHmWbp6MK5PV1ky1pf4TUnsx8Vb.ogg"},{"description":"Serina_MemorialLobby_5_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"……先生のおかげです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/SJG32luh9jfsWgrPTRYoJb8R02b5XCgD.ogg"},{"description":"Serina_MemorialLobby_5_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"……先生のおかげなんです、この気持ちは。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/B2qUsHK5m7cScfwPZABJVAMKJVdT7R8M.ogg"},{"description":"Serina_Relationship_Up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"先生と一緒にいると、私の心が癒されるようです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/96ObSMrM4HtpY9kYYJacIHCJX0OuFvjv.ogg"},{"description":"Serina_Relationship_Up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"ふふふ。幸せですね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/Z9LO1FGSLveOwlDDNqZdu0hfP431c4BA.ogg"},{"description":"Serina_Relationship_Up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"先生だけの主治医にはなれないですけど。いつでも先生のことを考えています！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/wZ5JOeTC98ZnA9XuVsIE35r7NOPvJGY3.ogg"},{"description":"Serina_Relationship_Up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"私たちで、平和な世界を作っていきましょう。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/GJGQieA3iTEZOlJriE0RcBQMYgjrTvDw.ogg"},{"description":"Serina_Season_Birthday.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"祝ってくださってありがとうございます。誕生日プレゼント、ですか？ 先生の笑顔だけでも十分ですよ！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/FlP4hyesIhimjYHemKzjiF1SYi9runlX.ogg"},{"description":"Serina_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"お誕生日おめでとうございます、先生！今日一日が、幸せでいっぱいであることを願っています！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/WlR1M3MSlPJnZ4wMZgJ4K6sIjMjxCqRj.ogg"},{"description":"Serina_Season_Halloween.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ハロウィンの飴をいただきました！ 飴は甘くて美味しいけど食べ過ぎるときっと虫歯になっちゃいます…。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/pzoC04GrSPNubkVAuMntDeEJzjl29DTT.ogg"},{"description":"Serina_Season_NewYear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"明けましておめでとうございます！新年から風邪ひかないように、しっかり暖かく着込んでくださいね！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/emQqtovnlGyVJwxprk7tBqMBFzE3g3pZ.ogg"},{"description":"Serina_Season_Xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"メリークリスマス、先生。今日ぐらいは皆さんケンカしないで、平和な一日になるといいですね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/zg1Kx7lEgE3qciNHRL3uklRKgUsemQdr.ogg"},{"description":"CBT_Serina_Nurse_Cafe_Act_1","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/f3yk7FYy7cFJUcsRKShUTavFa0mirCKe.wav"},{"description":"CBT_Serina_Nurse_Cafe_Act_2","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/fxTljb8Bfm0sYHL2njRuCrPBgq3segCt.wav"},{"description":"CBT_Serina_Nurse_Cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/YojVbZMg8i0R44oJq2i1fJlJgJpFC6zx.wav"},{"description":"CBT_Serina_Nurse_Cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%B9%AB%E8%A7%81%20%E8%8A%B9%E5%A8%9C/r10ylVo3hcvcT8MTaaNJJVPdOy2sA6En.wav"},{"de